            <ArticleTitle>Expanding the phenotype of DNAJC3 mutations: A case with hypothyroidism additionally to diabetes mellitus and multisystemic neurodegeneration.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>561-562</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1111/cge.13069</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Identification of this additional patient from a distant part of the originally described pedigree (Synofzik et al. 2014) confirms pathogenicity of DNAJC3 mutations. Hypothyroidism is a newly identified feature in addition to the known phenotype (diabetes with multisystemic neurodegeneration).</AbstractText>
